  subtitles:
  - start: 15.5
    end: 16.9
    speaker: SURVIVOR
    text: There you are...
  - start: 24.5
    end: 25.8
    speaker: PLAYER
    text: Where am I...?
  - start: 25.8
    end: 27.2
    speaker: SURVIVOR
    text: Keep your voice down.
  - start: 27.5
    end: 29.2
    speaker: PLAYER
    text: How long was I in there?
  - start: 30.6
    end: 31.8
    speaker: SURVIVOR
    text: Ten years.
  - start: 32.1
    end: 33.4
    speaker: PLAYER
    text: ...Ten years?
  - start: 34
    end: 35.2
    speaker: PLAYER
    text: Astra Eden?
  - start: 35.5
    end: 36.7
    speaker: SURVIVOR
    text: They took it.
  - start: 37
    end: 38.4
    speaker: SURVIVOR
    text: We tried to fight them.
  - start: 38.6
    end: 40
    speaker: SURVIVOR
    text: But too many people fell.
  - start: 40
    end: 41.3
    speaker: SURVIVOR
    text: They captured the dinosaurs and stripped the island bare.
  - start: 41.4
    end: 42.6
    speaker: SURVIVOR
    text: We don't have time.
  - start: 42.8
    end: 45.2
    speaker: SURVIVOR
    text: If you want our home back... first we need to get out of here.
